Even if this book is not a proper atlas, even if it has small-sized illustrations, it should be worthy of the grand panorama of medieval documents in the catalog!
(Moreover, many images can be readily obtained from industry-related resources in an uncorrupted state), so what is the difference between compiling a book with such images and without?
! I am sorry for such a scholarly spirit.
On matters of writing, there is no room for evaluation; Fǔjiā each have their own discernment.
Overall 2 stars.
Excellent shopping.
Great service!
I still trust Amazon’s own goods. Since I started shopping overseas via Amazon Express, it has been very convenient and the shipping time from abroad to China is only a few days longer than domestic shipments, which means that Amazon's customs clearance capabilities for overseas purchases have definitely been stronger than those of transit services, making them much faster, so many people now buy things on Amazon Express.
I hope that the quality and price of domestic products can improve. Many things are produced domestically but cost more when bought abroad than in China. I hope to see improvements in this regard.
Got someone else's unwrapped gift.
It would be much more reasonable to collect taxes at a rate of over one hundred dollars per three hundred machines when they are currently taxed at six hundred dollars each.
When they received it, the seal tape was looking off, as if it had been opened before. I quickly took photos of them, and sure enough, when I tore it open, it broke apart, exposing damaged cardboard. It’s worried that someone else may have returned it, so I gave it to my husband for his first test just ahead of the anniversary. Fortunately, there were no burrs in the knife head, or what would happen if he retailed from such a distance?
It is not known whether it will work well or if there might be any problems in the short term. As with previous reviews, items that were shipped when out of stock turned out to be unreliable!
It's good for East or West; but Amazon's customer service is really worse than that of other websites.
After placing an order and realizing it was placed incorrectly, but there is no way to cancel the order, the online customer service always displays an error link that cannot be contacted.
After delivery, the delivery person called me and said I didn't want it anymore; I wanted to cancel the order but it wasn't successful. The delivery person took it back and said they would sign for it first so that I could apply for a return.
When requesting a return, it is only then that you learn that food items cannot be returned once delivered, and there's no way to contact Amazon customer service either.
I have returned items on JD and Suning that I could not return because they were policy-restricted goods, such as milk and diapers; when I contacted customer service for returns, they all accepted them, with JD even returning diapers that smelled bad after opening. However, at Amazon it is impossible to do so.
Rules can be dead; people are alive. Tell me how they handled it with you in customer service?
Tell me you either get it yourself or let the delivery guy buy it for himself, because he's already having trouble getting enough to eat! I have no right to make him pay for something that’s not his own purchase?
Okay, I won't be retreating either; I'll accept it myself and will give your service one star.
Amazon's own products shouldn't feature such items.
Buy during sales prices for better deals; the reviews also indicate that it is a good product.
When I received the products, it left me astounded; the surface of the item was heavily scratched, and there were multiple other places that were similarly damaged. These items are either second-hand or old goods, or at least one is likely to be defective (see attachment).
I am applying for a return; the manufacturer's people say it was caused by transportation, is this not nonsense?
How can something wear out inside?
There can be only two possibilities: either it is counterfeit or I damaged it on purpose and am returning it.
In essence, I do not have any evidence to prove that I did not damage the product, but based on my record of Amazon purchases, I believe such products should not be present in Amazon's own goods and that customers choosing Amazon is trust; customer wins, we also win. Customer’s victory means manufacturer’s success; let us all work together to improve and thank you.
Very satisfied with the watch.
It is definitely genuine; I have checked it at the boutique and the watch looks very nice in appearance with fine workmanship. The materials used are sufficient, and as it has an imported mechanical movement, it carries some weight. It cannot be compared to those so-called mechanical watches priced around 300 yuan. This is authentic merchandise.
The watch is accurate; the error is within acceptable limits. A certificate of jewelry appraisal is included in the packaging, and at 12 o'clock on the dial is real diamond. This piece is very suitable to wear and is also highly prestigious as a gift to give out.
Yes, it is indeed excellent.
Lightweight and High-Capacity
I like how light it is and big in size; but I find having two separate partition bags redundant for me. I'm not sure what to put in each one.
After checking, I realized that Overseas Purchase had another brand nearly identical to it for less than two hundred bucks.
There was a problem with the first purchase; all the lights were flashing and not functional.
We want a refund; it took three days to receive the goods in Shanghai and they have not been delivered.
Don't even answer the delivery call.
The courier company says they only have that contact info.
Amazon is unable to find a place for complaints.
I was not asked to do anything, so it's completely unexpected and without cause for me to delay delivery - I got this message saying that the order would be delayed due to my request for an extended delivery window.
And then it was explained about transit issues.
After all, the poor shopping experience has me questioning the effectiveness of Amazon's logistics and control systems.
I estimate I won’t get it today either.
